---
/** Meter: a reading within a range: its label and value, a thin well filled with ink, and the ends of the scale. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="width:200px; padding:18px 16px; --gap:12px">
  <span class="cover-line"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:56px"></i><span class="cover-end"><i class="cover-bar" style="width:36px"></i></span></span>
  <span class="cover-track" style="--fill:72%"></span>
  <span class="cover-line" style="justify-content:space-between"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:14px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:14px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:14px"></i></span>
</span>
